UID:try-hockey-free-20261003@paulsnider.net
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Ages 4+. Cost: FREE\; registration required. Bring a helmet (b
 ike helmet works fine)\, warm winter pants and jacket\, and winter gloves.
  Skates and hockey sticks are provided. Each registered player receives a 
 free arcade card good for one hour of non-redemption games\; pick it up at
  check-in. The card may be used on a different date\, but its 60-minute ti
 mer starts when first swiped.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-IMPORT-TYPE:MANUAL
X-SOURCE-CALENDAR:Family Email Events
END:VEVENT
